<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-14T14:22:18.977Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:22:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violence has intensified in Manipur with gunmen killing four Naga civilians on the Imphal-Ukhrul highway, a sniper killing four Tangkhul Nagas on the same route, and suspected militants opening fire on two vehicles in Ukhrul, killing four travelers; in Kangpokpi district a woman farmer was killed and three men wounded, and a bandh over the killing of a Kuki woman disrupted normal life. In Kashmir security forces conducted a joint mock drill in Bandipora’s Hajin area and placed forces on high alert after two SPOs were killed in Kishtwar. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rediff&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPREhDQzIybl90R3ZGeVk3THlQV2oyLVZjUmVXNWF1MXZvU0lIbnBrS2R2SDY4RE9reWdhZ1h5ZUhfcHd4aDJBZXhpNGMxRC1Da0VKWGRZdnE5bUtnOW1YMXdCNVEyam14Wm5NOTZsTDBYV1FqU1JtaVNDMGI2MU1GUDhKNFlETlV1YWVoU3NILVVkb1ZRcHdNT0YyOUdwVG1vdWQwYVVnVVc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rediff&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQaFFubG9udHNkRXNWNnIzdVZEUDNlQmgyay1oaWFyUUxKanhfemR2UTZIbExBRXRGWmdkTm13VTd1OTVtVFM4blZhUHVvenZzUjd6NmpCUmloM1JnbDVNRUZtdndCYVBQU2dFcXIyRUR0bHNNUTJFN1RETEtNNzRuLVd0d1Jaa3I5cjJ2UDZBbHNsVjdJR1Bucg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ukhrul Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE9wTEVwSTVhQkZmQmJnVUFJeFdnYXdQRzgyMUZ2UTZWb3lWbXY2NXdZU2pmekx2eEI5bi1icG0wclJKbFpDNnRCLWI1Ny16Vkpld2labnNWVXZUUFB3WWtqUXVkVUZ0TEVLZURPb0l0aWtKX21YbFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rising Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPZDNZdmtTVGxXemhycjFNaWU2c3ZRY2VPVlQ3N3hiem45OVRvcEhILUZoeGhmVlR0R3ZoRzZoV1Vva3MzSnM4UEhnOFllWlRqeUl0ZEdZMlFMdmZ2NUQzVTMzUVh0dVVWMi1ST05CajEwRkotQnUwSmtpOTM4cERjUnRTQlZqOFNOZHFfRTZUXzVOaXJIZW11NVVDVGxSekl